# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine 5.8 — .gitignore
# Save this file as ".gitignore" in your repo root.
#
# Note: /Build/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Despite the name it holds source
# files UE needs (icons, packaging settings, platform configs). Packaged output
# goes to /Packaged/ instead, which is ignored below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated by the engine and the build system
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Same, for plugins in the project
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Packaged builds (see note above about /Build/)
/Packaged/
/Builds/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user

# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml

# Xcode / macOS
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
.DS_Store

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Crash dumps and logs
*.log
*.dmp
*.stackdump

# Local-only overrides — keep your machine's settings out of the repo
Config/*Local*.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately tracked, do not add these:
#   Config/           project settings, must be shared
#   Content/          your assets (via Git LFS — see .gitattributes)
#   Source/           your C++
#   Build/            packaging inputs
#   *.uproject        the project file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
